Output static/img/terminal/build-workflow.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 960
Set Height 540
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell "bash"

Type "freight check"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "freight fetch"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "freight build --graph"
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "freight build --time-passes"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "freight test"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "freight run -- --help"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
